# Frontend environment example — copy to `.env` to override defaults.
#
# VITE_API_BASE: base URL for the DisasterLens backend API.
# - Default (when unset) is the relative path `/api`, which uses the
#   existing Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) and same-origin in prod.
# - For local dev you MAY point directly at the backend instead:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000/api
